cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AHFSD — Augmented Hymns for Solitary Dances"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
license: MIT
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
abstract: "Real-time interactive sound system for AHFSD, a participatory
  performance for up to ten people at the Immersive Art Space, ZHdK.
  Motion capture reads the collective behaviour of the audience and a
  Max/MSP system answers in spatialised sound and light."
authors:
  - given-names: Marco Mercuzio
    family-names: Peron
    affiliation: "Zürcher Hochschule der Künste (ZHdK)"
keywords:
  - interactive sound
  - spatial audio
  - artistic research
  - motion capture
